          "message": "chore(deps): update dependency knip to v6.15.0 (#196)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [knip](https://knip.dev)\n([source](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/tree/HEAD/packages/knip))\n| [`6.14.2` →\n`6.15.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/knip/6.14.2/6.15.0) |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/knip/6.15.0?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/knip/6.14.2/6.15.0?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>webpro-nl/knip (knip)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v6.15.0`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/releases/tag/knip%406.15.0):\nRelease 6.15.0\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/compare/knip@6.14.2...knip@6.15.0)\n\n- Report exported type used only in inferred-return function body\n(resolve\n[#&#8203;1765](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1765))\n([`2413408`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/2413408753f7abc7a9dfdba520990afd18c53ee0))\n- Work that EXPORTS.md again\n([`7e13451`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/7e13451fab7ad85362fb63a4715ea450690aedef))\n- Update npmx ecosystem snapshot\n([`dfc4011`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/dfc401145a880f156c66eb83ea1622a99540304a))\n- Link `dependencies` key with notes (closes\n[#&#8203;1764](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1764))\n([`e3e66ce`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/e3e66cea9e946558940bf8705129efea3f23b3ba))\n- Resolve tsconfig paths when loading plugin configs\n([#&#8203;1762](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1762))\n([`0177c74`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/0177c7466559e2ae99b5e1cd1e3a8043ca494edc))\n- thanks\n[@&#8203;jakeleventhal](https://redirect.github.com/jakeleventhal)!\n- Avoid caching failed plugin config loads\n([#&#8203;1768](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1768))\n([`5e201cd`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/5e201cde9b1ba2568ead2ae790ab888c966828ae))\n- thanks\n[@&#8203;jakeleventhal](https://redirect.github.com/jakeleventhal)!\n- Resolve extensionless .sass imports in SCSS compiler\n([#&#8203;1770](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1770))\n([`30c2283`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/30c22835383b2355787cc2a871b22de80ff75544))\n- thanks\n[@&#8203;sebacardello](https://redirect.github.com/sebacardello)!\n- fix(vite): detect inline module script entry points in index.html\n([#&#8203;1772](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1772))\n([`51f4edd`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/51f4eddc9e1b2fed1ba25e81fc596e9fb514ce01))\n- thanks [@&#8203;lucas-spin](https://redirect.github.com/lucas-spin)!\n- Harden vite inline module script import detection\n([`b8abcfd`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/b8abcfd2f4f5486aea08a934514bc55de86be030))\n- Use RecordableHistogram for timerified function stats\n([`d575c69`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/d575c6905704af1b0b4620edd874fc09bc86ed28))\n- Add orval plugin (resolves\n[#&#8203;1751](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1751))\n([`4c82aa8`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/4c82aa82c2a02fbda27a316389f210d11621f8cb))\n- Add treatTagHintsAsErrors and --no-tag-hints (resolves\n[#&#8203;1767](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1767))\n([`4b6a573`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/4b6a573e0c1e0daf65c76c32f7336ea71db6bb64))\n- Add nano-spawn plugin (resolves\n[#&#8203;1769](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/issues/1769))\n([`b2cad06`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/b2cad06dfd9958485537c5545c6c497fc8823ac3))\n- Simplify glob cache validation and ignore-list assembly\n([`df1a960`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/df1a9603a5ea8ed7bad9588bf13672cedf37c90e))\n- Dedupe ignore-pattern collection and dependency fixing\n([`d49b626`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/d49b626ad6736d7123d44568ef8c42a3e1d28aa3))\n- Simplify installed-binaries collection in manifest metadata\n([`5514394`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/55143941eebbc8dac12c79b77c1f65a8b61dfbef))\n- Flatten control flow in ConfigurationChief\n([`010d570`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/010d5709b0f9a3adc5ebe6e7169b9f5c4f29abc5))\n- Inline trivial installed-binaries and types-included accessors\n([`b5afb9f`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/b5afb9f29e3474eee4bf276c1de83cb0682a5663))\n- Format\n([`eb4b178`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/eb4b178d5d90a719cdc576d644766f8f95a47876))\n- Replace [@&#8203;wdio/types](https://redirect.github.com/wdio/types)\ndev dep with inline types\n([`a3747d6`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/a3747d61ee0e594854e5da0ca6cb7597e0096b99))\n- Bump dependencies\n([`822ab39`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/822ab3905cb7b5a216404231607a7820105930a2))\n- Work AGENTS.md, etcetera\n([`361bd48`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/361bd4803934a01e01b08170565f8374e4e49eb2))\n- Remove rootDirs workaround resolved by oxc-resolver 11.20.0\n([`e190a9f`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/e190a9fec22db41975cf9568a31970a05c86e66b))\n- Add nuxt no-root-tsconfig fixture guarding alias resolution\n([`e3e5bc9`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/e3e5bc94d5f7b6ffdbc89b18d7c8d5acbb5a9008))\n- Allow extra args for release-it\n([`f9c5995`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/f9c59952fa2c8c4c13bd42edc0935610900d1980))\n- Add [@&#8203;vercel](https://redirect.github.com/vercel) as platinum\nsponsor\n([`c4c06a9`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/c4c06a9149c986680f0d1aa74b57a46ff1f88601))\n- Overhaul & improve --trace functionailty\n([`60df0b0`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/60df0b05f364c8d841c0f784a06bab2a3215a32f))\n- Re-gen plugins.md\n([`0f9d044`](https://redirect.github.com/webpro-nl/knip/commit/0f9d044d312053154498a562e3a9422a4f44afe6))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/mikrojs/mikro).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4yMDYuMSIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQzLjIwNi4xIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6W119-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
