          "distinct": true,
          "id": "cd9cec092f2cf7ab5246f154dd4081af1376c281",
          "message": "fix(native): ship abort polyfill as precompiled bytecode (#217)\n\nParsing the polyfill source at first access peaked ~15KB on a near-full\nheap, and the lazy getter swallowed the OOM, leaving AbortController\nsilently undefined on low-memory chips. Evaluate the polyfill from\nbytecode like every other builtin, and propagate install errors instead\nof returning undefined.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-11T18:41:15.934Z",
