          "id": "2cf1080ccf03b556234dcc536f9def3466e33d22",
          "message": "fix(wifi): refuse start under low heap instead of PHY abort (#225)\n\nesp_wifi_start() enables the PHY, which allocates its RF calibration\ndata from internal RAM and calls abort() on failure, hard-rebooting the\ndevice instead of surfacing a catchable error. Pre-flight internal heap\nbefore starting the radio and return ESP_ERR_NO_MEM, which the caller\nalready maps to a StartFailed result.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-11T19:53:52.636Z",
          "tree_id": "",
