          "id": "44e6fc5ff950bc2f9d40f1e249a50fc763f5f117",
          "message": "feat(cli): offer to reflash incompatible device firmware (#227)\n\ndev, deploy, and console now probe firmware compatibility before\nconnecting and, when the device is out of the CLI's range, offer to\nflash CLI-matched firmware (-y/--yes skips the prompt) instead of\ndead-ending on a version error. They flash and exit with a re-run hint\nrather than reconnecting, since the device re-enumerates on reset.",
