          "id": "a1a5029379b2068bdd9f0491fe2423548b29bd96",
          "message": "fix(firmware): pick up version changes without a clean build (#233)\n\nMIK_FW_VERSION is read from package.json at configure time, but the file\nwas not a configure dependency, so incremental builds kept flashing\nbinaries that report a stale version until a fullclean. Declare it via\nCMAKE_CONFIGURE_DEPENDS in both the ESP-IDF component and the host\nlibrary.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-12T22:43:36.833Z",
