          "distinct": true,
          "id": "0ca6b03972fff28adbe1714213a8b431966d3dc7",
          "message": "fix(cli): treat native: specifiers as firmware builtins in the tracer (#245)\n\nThe app import tracer resolved native: imports as real on-disk modules\nand failed when an app imported app-local native code\n(`native:<pkg>/<id>`). The `native:` scheme is firmware-only and is\nbound on-device against the registered native modules, so\nisBuiltinModule now reports it as a builtin and the tracer skips it.\nThis matches the esbuild externals plugin, which already externalized\nnative:, and lets app-local native code be imported without promoting it\nto a package with a `./cmake export`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-13T21:10:50.971Z",
