          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b6d00302e10142027c9f53c727aa845434ec138e",
          "message": "feat(i2s): add I2S audio module for mic capture and playback (#246)\n\nAdds the mikro/i2s module: a native I2S driver with an async queued\nwrite() for playback and a blocking bulk capture() tuned for streaming\nmic input (24-in-32 to int16 packing done in C). Standard and PDM RX\nmodes, with direction inferred from the pins provided.\n\nShips TypeScript types, host C++ tests, API docs, and a network-mic\nexample that streams an ICS-43434 over HTTP.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-14T11:30:49.106Z",
