          "id": "c47a813d58596f98d092079e2ec04cf09c5c45e2",
          "message": "fix(firmware): stop spi/uart/i2c write over-reading buffer views (#247)\n\nJS_GetArrayBuffer reports the whole backing buffer, which clobbered the\ntyped-array view length and let a subarray view over-read past its end.\nRead the buffer length into a throwaway and keep the view length, the\nsame fix already applied to i2s.",
