          "id": "28f8ba056b398feef655fcf567aa3ca874d5e8c4",
          "message": "feat(wifi)!: configure txPower on connect, power radio down on disconnect (#250)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: wifi.connect() now takes an options object `{ssid,\npassphrase, txPower?}` instead of positional arguments.\n`wifi.disconnect()` now powers the radio down and frees its heap by\ndefault; pass `{shutdown: false}` to keep it up for a fast reconnect.\n`wifi.txPower` is read-only; set it via `connect({txPower})`.",
