          "id": "a45f29c540e658685b08f98d2f79ed67a2458f27",
          "message": "fix(cli): root the deploy tree at the entry's top-level dir (#258)\n\nEntries nested deeper than one level (mikro dev app/debug/test.ts) placed package.json and mikro.config.json outside the firmware's one-level package.json search, and a ./ prefix on the entry produced a doubled tree (app/debug/app/debug/...). build() now normalizes the entry path and defaults the deploy root to the entry's first path segment; the test runner's app-root heuristic uses the same rule.",
