          "id": "9ac309ae141635bbb8c27675d54473069c10fa18",
          "message": "feat(kv)!: reserve the mik.sys NVS namespace for runtime state (#274)\n\nKeeps runtime-internal state out of the app-facing store: `nvsStorage.clear()` wipes app data only, and `clear({full: true})` opts in to also wiping the system store, attempting both wipes even if one fails and returning the first error.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `nvsStorage.clear()` now returns `Result<void, KVError>` instead `void`; handle it or call `.orPanic()`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-19T13:07:14.318Z",
