          "id": "753f5c5b04dffd3a0fbaa83f1781ed4d7cd6973f",
          "message": "perf(native): preallocate module file buffer to avoid 1.5x growth peak (#295)\n\nmik__load_file let the DynBuf grow 1.5x from zero, peaking at ~2.5x\nthe file size mid-copy during module load. fstat the fd and claim the\nexact size up front; +4 covers the NUL/wrapper suffix callers append.",
