          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f42b1a6becdd456b6f47e5e4d3716182d7f19882",
          "message": "fix(quickjs): guard the configure-time patch sync for CMake script mode (#301)\n\nESP-IDF's early component-requirements pass includes quickjs.cmake via script-mode CMake, where the CONFIGURE_DEPENDS glob is a hard error — every firmware build (and the v0.17.1 release) failed at configure. The requirements pass only needs the variables; the real project-mode configure still runs the sync. Host builds never take the script-mode path, which is why this passed everywhere except firmware CI.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-31T00:14:23.058Z",
